ALS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a ritual altar to harness the energy of anomalous artifacts and practice dark arts. Convert their energy to duplicate any item placed at the altar, cheap ones are easy, but valuable ones demand much more power.</p>", "short_description": "SANCTION is a procedurally generated FPS/RPG where you are a prisoner sanctioned to come from the safety of your doomsday bunker to gather supplies for the community. Your freedom and your community's livelihood rely on you. Survive the desolate wasteland left by the final war.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191080/f6000e19ee314c7b8ceb9a5d19cf66852f983cec/header.jpg?t=1784348544", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191080/ec8745d7eb8a77bd76877e998c8a83252454fbf0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784348544", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1191080/ec8745d7eb8a77bd76877e998c8a83252454fbf0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784348544", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 Version 21H1 or Newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA® GeForce® GTX 1060 6 GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Discrete GPU Highly Recommended</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows® 10 Version 21H1 or Newer<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™5 